EFpB59MJ", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53954, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01M3CLSNQAryMwBfEFpB59MJ", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 55018, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01MRFTJYJY72325LkT2ZzBEG", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 55318, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01MRFTJYJY72325LkT2ZzBEG", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 55318, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01MRFTJYJY72325LkT2ZzBEG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 60232, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. I also opened a SEV2 incident, INC-0001.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- v2.3.0 is the most recent healthy release. Both v2.3.1 and the v2.3.1-rc before it were unhealthy, so the rc wasn't a safe target.\n- My first rollback attempt stopped after us-east because of an error in the deployment system. That left us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1, so I ran the rollback again and it finished.\n- us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0 now. Health checks pass, and the error rate dropped from 18% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api):**\n- The request to create it timed out. The incident list showed it had been created and is open, so I didn't send it again and page on-call twice.\n- The summary covers the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, the partial first attempt and the retry, and the current healthy state. It lists two follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, and find out why the deployment system stopped the first rollback.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JnUjM9giDbqSPJwftph9KC", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01JLqag6HLB5Z6crBTR9fJUr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (v2.3.1-rc and v2.3.1 are both unhealthy). Rolling back.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01PdACyRecDrmzRmY2AvPLqL", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01JGCbVDUhWVgGCQZFjbw51W", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback only finished in us-east. Retrying for the other regions, since rolling back to the same version is safe to repeat.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01MYkVVBJ323p6Z5L1Tx9m5q", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01YGhSCgEF9bUFcBkPiivVcK", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null