% to 0.2%.\n\n**Incident INC-0001 (SEV2, checkout-api):**\n- The request to create it timed out. The incident list showed it had been created and is open, so I didn't send it again and page on-call twice.\n- The summary covers the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, the partial first attempt and the retry, and the current healthy state. It lists two follow-ups: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure, and find out why the deployment system stopped the first rollback.", "type": "text"}]}]}